    "qIndex": 26,
    "questionNumber": 26,
    "stem": "It is suggested in Paragraph 1 that \"behavioural\" ads help advertisers to _______.",
    "stemTranslation": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "lower their operational costs.",
        "isCorrect": true,
        "analysis": "定位至首段 S1-S3：“half of all advertising budgets are wasted ... this fraction can be much reduced. By watching what people search for ... companies can aim 'behavioural' ads at those most likely to buy.” 传统广告有一半预算因盲目投放而被白白浪费，而行为广告能精准将广告推给最可能购买的用户，使‘被浪费的这一份额大幅降低（fraction can be much reduced）’，这直接等同于帮广告商节省广告开支、降低营运成本（lower their operational costs）。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "ease",
            "ipa": "[iːz]",
            "meaning": "缓和",
            "level": "green",
            "isSelfAnnotated": false
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": false
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "ease competition among themselves.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "UNFOUNDED",
        "analysis": "无中生有。文中并未讨论广告商之间的内部竞争，更未提及行为广告能够缓解竞争同行间的关系。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "lower",
            "ipa": "[ˈləʊə(r)]",
            "meaning": "降低",
            "level": "green",
            "isSelfAnnotated": false
          },
          {
            "word": "operational",
            "ipa": "[ˌɒpəˈreɪʃən(ə)l]",
            "meaning": "运营的",
            "level": "red",
            "isSelfAnnotated": true
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": true
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "text": "avoid complaints from consumers.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "UNFOUNDED",
        "analysis": "无中生有。首段完全聚焦于商业预算的有效使用，从未讨论消费者投诉或抱怨（complaints）。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "avoid",
            "ipa": "[əˈvɔɪd]",
            "meaning": "避免",
            "level": "green",
            "isSelfAnnotated": false
          },
          {
            "word": "complaints",
            "ipa": "",
            "meaning": "投诉",
            "level": "red",
            "isSelfAnnotated": true
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": true
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "provide better online services.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "UNFOUNDED",
        "analysis": "无中生有。首段探讨的是广告商如何精准定位买家以减少预算浪费，未提及提供更优良的线上服务（online services）。"
      }
    ],
    "officialAnswer": "A",
    "standardType": "DETAIL",
    "type": null,
    "targetSentences": null,
    "verbatimEvidence": null,
    "synonymMapping": {
      "lower their operational costs": "half of all advertising budgets are wasted ... this fraction can be much reduced (一半广告预算被浪费 ... 这一被浪费的份额可以大幅减少 -> 降低企业的营运/广告成本)"
    },
    "methodologyReview": "首段推断细节题。解题眼在于对‘this fraction can be much reduced’的代词回指理解。fraction 指代上一句中‘half of all advertising budgets are wasted’（被浪费的那一半预算）。减少被浪费的预算，本质就是缩减商业推广开支、降低运营成本，lower their operational costs 构成了完美的逻辑同义转述。",
